# Obsidian plugin install path

After any change to `bible-viewer/` (especially `main.ts`, `main.js`, `manifest.json`, `styles.css`):

1. Rebuild `main.js` if `main.ts` changed.
2. Copy `main.js`, `main.ts`, `manifest.json`, and `styles.css` to:

`obsidian/Bible/.obsidian/plugins/bible-viewer/`

Obsidian loads that vault folder, not the repo `bible-viewer/` copy unless they are the same path. Do not skip the copy.
